                      Pexp_constant PConst_string(" [add ~key ~data m] returns a map containing the same bindings as\n        [m], plus a binding of [key] to [data]. If [key] was already bound\n        in [m] to a value that is physically equal to [data],\n        [m] is returned unchanged (the result of the function is\n        then physically equal to [m]). Otherwise, the previous binding\n        of [key] in [m] disappears.\n        @before 4.03 Physical equality was not ensured. ",(stdlib/templates/map.template.mli[80,3072+4]..[86,3454+58]),None)
